# Node-side dev tests. rootDir is "." here and this list does not exclude JS by extension, so
# without this clasp pushes tests/*_test.js into the Apps Script project as .gs source — where it
# fails to parse and blocks the whole deploy. That is exactly what happened on 2026-08-22.
tests/
tests/**
**/*.html
!index.html
**/*.json
!appsscript.json
.claude/
clasp.sh
design_handoff_income_layout/**
